  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 2.8,
    "end": 7.7,
    "text": "I hate to break it to you there, Eleven, but that's just wind."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 7.7,
    "end": 9.34,
    "text": "That's how wind works."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 9.34,
    "end": 10.34,
    "text": "That's not telekinesis."
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 10.34,
    "end": 12.18,
    "text": "There's a reason you're using tinfoil."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 12.18,
    "end": 14.82,
    "text": "It's because it's really, really light and easy to move."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 14.82,
    "end": 18.94,
    "text": "And also, they're folded in such a way that air is caught much more easily."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 18.94,
    "end": 21.5,
    "text": "And I love you do this thing where you're going like this and you're like, look, they're"
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 21.5,
    "end": 22.5,
    "text": "barely moving."
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 22.5,
    "end": 25.54,
    "text": "And then they move, which is hilarious because it proves my point even more, but you're doing"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 25.54,
    "end": 26.54,
    "text": "this."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 26.54,
    "end": 27.54,
    "text": "You're barely doing anything."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 27.54,
    "end": 31.58,
    "text": "You're not, you're just flapping your hand loosely over the aluminum foil."
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 31.58,
    "end": 37.03,
    "text": "It's not going to push it forward and then you go like this, of course that's going to"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 37.03,
    "end": 38.03,
    "text": "move them."
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 38.03,
    "end": 39.03,
    "text": "You're pushing air towards them."
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 39.03,
    "end": 43.31,
    "text": "Now what I would love for you to try is take a piece, flatten it completely out so that"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 43.31,
    "end": 46.47,
    "text": "there's no lips, and then try the same thing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 46.47,
    "end": 50.63,
    "text": "You're going to notice it doesn't move much because now it's not able to catch wind easily"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 50.63,
    "end": 54.03,
    "text": "but I'll tell you what, if you do it under a live with me, under my conditions, do it"
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 54.03,
    "end": 58.39,
    "text": "under a sealed container, I'll give you $10,000, otherwise pack it up, Fecna."
   }
  ]
 },
